5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Let’s start by checking the winter road closures north of the river and the bus links in the two outer wards.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’d like to review the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I’ll examine the volunteer register and supervision training, plus the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I’ll look into the county grant terms and the endowment, and the running and equipment lines last year.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’ll check the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use, and the quoted delivery windows from suppliers.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, do you think those old records will actually tell us if the new ideas will hold up?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, they tell us what failed and why. Ignoring that history is how we repeat the same mistakes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, history is just data. I care more about whether the current staff can actually handle the workload.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, workload is only half the picture. I’m checking how the funding is structured to see if it survives past the first year.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, I’m worried about the physical reach. If the roads close or buses stop, no amount of good funding helps people who can’t get there.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, exactly. If the roads shut down, the service van is just a metal box. I need to know if we can actually reach those outer wards.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, reachability is vital, but I’m checking if the model itself is sound. We can’t fix a broken concept with better roads.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, a sound model is useless if the people running it are stretched thin. I’m verifying if the skills actually exist on the roster.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, skills matter, but if the money vanishes after year one, no amount of training keeps the lights on.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, I hear you on the money, but I’m checking if the timing even works. If people can’t reach us, the budget is just a number.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, I hope those old records show us how to build something that doesn’t collapse when the weather turns against us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, I hope they show us which models survived the winter, so we don’t waste time on ones that didn’t.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Yumi, I hope they show us which models survived the winter, so we don’t waste time on ones that didn’t.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Yumi, I hope they show us which models survived the winter, so we don’t waste time on ones that didn’t.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, I hope they show us which models survived the winter, so we don’t waste time on ones that didn’t.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
