35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Yumi**: The roads shut for eleven days, but the halls kept their evening timetables. That’s the resilience I need.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,- **Shion**: Interesting. So the community can self-organize when the infrastructure fails. That shifts the burden away from us.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"- **Minako**: The grant covers fees for twelve months, then the flat budget takes over. That cliff is where most projects die.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,- **Daisuke**: The scanning quotes slip whenever a bigger client books first. That’s a risk I can’t control.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Benjamin, did the old outreach stops actually draw crowds, or did they just vanish like the funding?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, they averaged forty visitors a session, beating the main building midweek. The demand was real, even if the funding wasn’t.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: @Benjamin, forty visitors is promising, but I’m checking if we have the trained staff to actually deliver that service.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"- **Minako**: @Shion, staffing is a concern, but the ledger shows our vehicle line overran by a third. That’s a structural leak, not just a people problem.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, that overrun is worrying, but my main worry is the delivery windows. If the equipment slips, the whole schedule collapses.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Daisuke, if the equipment slips, the whole schedule collapses.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, the delivery risk is real, but the attendance data proves the demand exists. We just need a model that doesn't rely on fragile supply chains.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, demand is irrelevant if the roster lacks the specific skills to deliver it. I’m checking if we can actually staff this.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, skills are vital, but the ledger shows the vehicle line overran by a third. That’s a structural leak, not just a people problem.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, I hear you on the leak, but I’m checking if the timing even works. If people can’t reach us, the budget is just a number.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, so the demand was real. I just need a delivery method that doesn’t break when the roads close or the suppliers delay.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, precisely. The records show which models survived the winter, so we don’t waste time on ones that didn’t.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, survival is nice, but I need to know if the skills are actually on the roster. I’m checking the volunteer register now.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, skills are vital, but the ledger shows the vehicle line overran by a third. That’s a structural leak, not just a people problem.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, I hear you on the leak, but I’m checking if the timing even works. If people can’t reach us, the budget is just a number.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
