60,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: So, which of these four candidates actually fits what we’ve found?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Yumi, the records suggest we avoid repeating the unindexed digitisation failure. I’m leaning toward the mobile service, given the attendance data.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, the mobile service requires staff to drive and manage a vehicle. My checks show no one on the payroll is trained to supervise outside facilitators or handle that specific logistics burden.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, the vehicle line already overran by a third. Adding a mobile branch without fixing that structural leak is financial suicide.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, the vehicle overrun is real, but the bus links are gone. If we don’t go to them, they can’t reach us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Daisuke, you’re right. The halls proved people will come if we meet them halfway. I’m leaning toward the mobile service too.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, the mobile service addresses the reach gap, but the vehicle costs are a known liability. I’m hesitant to bet on it without a cost fix.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, the vehicle cost is a leak, but the skill gap is a wall. We lack the certified supervisors to run it safely.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, the skill gap is real, but the funding cliff is the killer. The grant ends, the flat budget absorbs it, and we’re stuck.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, the funding cliff is real, but the bus links are gone. If we don’t go to them, they can’t reach us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Minako, the funding cliff is scary, but the attendance sheets prove the demand is real. We can’t ignore the people stuck without bus links.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, the demand is real, but the vehicle overrun is a structural leak. We can’t fix a broken budget with good intentions.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, the budget is a constraint, not a wall. I’m checking if the neighbourhood associations can fill the skill gap we lack.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, the associations help, but the grant ends after twelve months. The flat budget then carries the cost, and that’s where the money disappears.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, I understand the budget risk, but the bus links are gone. If we don’t go to them, they can’t reach us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Daisuke, I agree. The mobile service is the only option that actually reaches the people we’re losing. I’m voting for it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, I’m voting for the Mobile Branch Service. The attendance data is undeniable, and the reach gap is critical.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, I’m voting for the Mobile Branch Service. The associations can cover the skill gap, and the reach is undeniable.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I’m voting for the Mobile Branch Service. The reach is critical, and the funding structure, while risky, is manageable if we monitor the vehicle line closely.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, I’m voting for the Mobile Branch Service. The bus links are gone, and this is the only way to reach them.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
